For a family of nonzero pairs `(c,d) ∈ 𝓞_F²`, pairwise inequivalent under scaling by units,
`∑ I_{(c,d)}(P)^σ < ∞` for `σ > 2` (`summable_pairHt_rpow`).  Proof: by Dirichlet's unit theorem
